- [`libs/migrate/src/migrate/refusals.py`](file:///Users/kaygee/Code/loops-wt/s4-wp1/libs/migrate/src/migrate/refusals.py): Refusal hierarchy rooted in [`MigrationRefused`](file:///Users/kaygee/Code/loops-wt/s4-wp1/libs/migrate/src/migrate/refusals.py#L23-L28) (independent from `ArrivalBodyError` and `ContractRefusal`). Subclass [`MixedObserverBatchRefused`](file:///Users/kaygee/Code/loops-wt/s4-wp1/libs/migrate/src/migrate/refusals.py#L31-L60) asserts the source location claim ("these source lines carry rows from more than one observer, which this transformer cannot map to one record"), carries structured `offending_lines: tuple[tuple[int, tuple[str, ...]], ...]`, and provides advisory operator prose in message only. [`AbsentObserverBatchRefused`](file:///Users/kaygee/Code/loops-wt/s4-wp1/libs/migrate/src/migrate/refusals.py#L62-L91) represents missing observer fields distinctly without folding `None` into observer sets.
