- [`libs/migrate/tests/test_inventory.py`](file:///Users/kaygee/Code/loops-wt/s4-wp1/libs/migrate/tests/test_inventory.py): Inventory count verification against hand-computed expectations, JSONL vs SQLite content hash equivalence, GF-3 refusal with full line enumeration, absent-observer distinction, two-hash stability across SQLite VACUUM, and read-only verification.
- [`libs/migrate/tests/test_legacy_readers.py`](file:///Users/kaygee/Code/loops-wt/s4-wp1/libs/migrate/tests/test_legacy_readers.py): Unit tests for legacy JSONL decoding, legacy SQLite querying, and deterministic ID migration.
- [`libs/migrate/tests/test_refusals.py`](file:///Users/kaygee/Code/loops-wt/s4-wp1/libs/migrate/tests/test_refusals.py): Unit tests verifying the refusal hierarchy, lack of inheritance from `ArrivalBodyError`, and message/structured data contracts.

